{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1471.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"b5c6e19be8849dd04e693729320549509c5f42320ad361b695dfdb0387d9f1a2","ja":"ところで杏奈ちゃん、イベントの時は、\n手加減してくれてたのでしょうか～？","zh":"话说杏奈，活动的时候，\n有手下留情吗～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1471.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"24c699a4f545fdfe2c457c203ff80592bf04e9607e9cbf1661e125e2d3879867","ja":"……うん……あの時、\n使ってなかった技とか……知識はある、けど……。","zh":"……嗯……当时\n没用上的技巧和……知识是有的，但是……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1471.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"b06e1113edb786928a8b732745ab85533597a71fa622369c207997a6f33afaa1","ja":"手を抜いてた……とかじゃ、なくて……\n必要、なかっただけ……。","zh":"并不是……在偷懒……\n只是没那个……必要而已……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1471.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"07403754d387253690dcb7fcae4d37a99eb0eba9bfbe5ea02e019f2e9cd99610","ja":"む～ん……\nそれはどういうことでしょう～？","zh":"唔～……\n那是怎么一回事呢～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1471.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"094da0d9e69926d0c99d1629e8c6e8a4141602c35c325db45dd48a3d9fb129d8","ja":"イベントの時は……みんなで楽しんでる様子を、\n見せてほしいって……言われてて……。","zh":"活动的时候……有人跟我说……\n希望大家能展现出……开开心心的样子……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1471.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"fabe4d95050402c1b7e7eac5cdb3e69348cae070957367d7936696a63d7d9883","ja":"本気の、勝負の時と……友達と遊ぶ時は、\n楽しみ方が……違う、っていうか……。","zh":"动真格一决胜负的时候……和朋友玩耍的时候，\n享受的方式……不太一样，该说是……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1471.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"af2a4eb00ef2c1af65aca2d82336926fe954b4b2125549eb1e1052195ac5bed7","ja":"あー、その感覚、わかるかも。\nアタシの場合は、ダンスだけどさ。","zh":"啊——那种感觉，我也许懂。\n不过对我来说，是在跳舞的时候就是了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1471.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"fecfa547fbfbd1c0498a84e4d9d3a7272bcb7bd69c65ac29fabdcbfed3f3a4f4","ja":"友達とちょっとした遊びで踊るときって、\nテクニックより、楽しむことを考えてる、って感じ？","zh":"跟朋友随便跳着玩的时候，\n比起技巧，感觉更多是在想着要开心？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1471.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"cf54914081ca2b82bb2a96f9f98450d3f33cb3b4ef1dc188a9f949f6488fcd65","ja":"なるほど～。みんなでわいわい楽しむ分には、\n勝つための技とかはいらん、っちゅうことやな。","zh":"原来如此～如果是大家一起热热闹闹地玩，\n就不需要什么求胜的技巧了，是这个意思吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1471.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"514a9eef5dfcdb61d868a8efed9d9993f7c10fd62f30abbed2468cf7ab21c56e","ja":"でも私としては、\n本気の杏奈との勝負も興味あるけどな！","zh":"不过对我来说，\n倒是挺想和动真格的杏奈较量一下的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1471.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"71a9b63dfbb5784bbab59a6a55f388ab4afaa41f5df815eef51ed076f3436901","ja":"たしかに、本気の杏奈ちゃんに\nみんなで挑むというのも、面白そうですね～。","zh":"确实，大家一起去向认真的杏奈\n发起挑战，听起来也挺有意思呢～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1471.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"f6b9a99b25bf49fc3aeac348d438bef71984e37aa204c51e33b071cc859f7dad","ja":"ん……わかった。\nみんなが、そう言うなら……受けて立つ、よ。","zh":"嗯……我知道了。\n既然大家都这么说……那我就接受挑战。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1471.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"095eff833215403c084f6acf42fea283a0a9d42eba1386dee9c64039abf6fc80","ja":"じゃあ、みんな……準備、いい……？\n3、2、1……スタート……！","zh":"那么，大家……准备好了……吗……？\n3、2、1……开始……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1471.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"68c5334bbe22706c8f7e6d47efc5d44376d9a2ea25308fb05d7105df94cf71c4","ja":"トップは私がもろた……って、ええーっ！？\nちょっ、スタートダッシュって、こないに速かった！？","zh":"第一名是我的了……等等，欸欸——！？\n等等，起跑冲刺有这么快的吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1471.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"dad039b48c9ad6ceaf32cf03fc8c8b453240d1327589d2b2da71b0f8d4f7a688","ja":"あっという間に、杏奈が画面から消えた……。","zh":"一眨眼的工夫，杏奈就从画面中消失了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1471.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"695429dc2d099a1e5548059db86d63ea4bc59902957ec8fd18532ec56b62cfbd","ja":"マイガー！\nやっぱり手加減してもらうんだったー！　","zh":"天哪！\n果然还是应该让人家放点水才对嘛——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
